<title>THAILAND: Sitca Investment unaudited 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Sitca Investment unaudited 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for</p>
<p>the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.02     vs	     4.78</p>
<p>    Net			422.85     vs	   411.01</p>
<p>NOTE: Sitca Investment and Securities Plc is a finance and securities firm. Fourth quarter figures not available.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
